WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Your website should do more than just tell
people you exist.

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.900
It should help the right customer
understand your offer,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.880
explain the next steps of what they need
to do in order to book

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.700
with you, and then also hear back from
your business all while

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.500
they are still interested.

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:15.360
At Aurex Business Labs, we build revenue
website systems for established

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.760
businesses in North Mississippi.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.260
That means a completely custom website
with clear messaging,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.720
focused conversion paths, lead tracking,

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.380
a CRM system, and automated follow-up.

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.700
Here's what it looks like. Someone finds
your business on Google.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.920
They understand what you do and then
request a quote.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.440
That inquiry goes into your business's
CRM.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.160
An automated response from your business
is triggered and sent

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:35.960
to that lead.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:38.440
And the original traffic source stays
connected with that opportunity

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.840
in your CRM so that you can track where
all your customers are

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:42.680
actually coming from.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.880
Our projects start at $3,500 with $1,750
being the deposit,

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.420
and then the other $1,750 paid once you
have approved and are

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:51.420
completely happy with your website and
complete setup.

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:53.800
And we put $1,000 on our launch
commitment,

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:56.580
which just means that if we did not
complete the project within

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.860
21 days after getting all of the assets
from you and everything,

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.680
and it's on us, we will actually pay you
$1,000 back from the

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:04.480
website build.

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:06.960
So that's how much that we guarantee that
we will get this done

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:08.420
in 21 days or less.

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:11.420
To start, I will go ahead and book your
website revenue review.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.740
We will look at your current website,

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:14.480
your path to inquiry, your offer,

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.280
your tracking, and your follow-up.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.440
You'll leave the call with a better
understanding of what needs

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:21.040
to happen next for your business and also
whether this is the

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.580
correct system for you and your business.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.500
So, click the button below and schedule
your free review now.
